{"synopsis":"Kepala sekte terakhir selalu tertawa, tetapi dia tidak pernah menyangka: Murid wanita dingin yang direkrut dengan santai menyembunyikan kengeriannya, dan murid pria yang menutup matanya di jalan untuk menyelamatkan sebenarnya adalah jenius pertama. Dia menendang bola ke kelahiran kembali Kaisar Wu menendang sekte itu untuk meragukan bahwa adik laki-laki yang melihat kesia-siaan dalam hidup adalah seorang jenius yang jatuh. Sekte ini semua mempesona … Tuhan ingin aku menentang langit, itu tidak bisa menghentikannya.","alternative_title":"万古最强宗","author":"阅文漫画, 烛道文化","artist":"烛道文化","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"9037e447-4ac8-4d5a-9c40-d174f88ee5a7","number":"541","chapter":"541","title":"","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"a4ec6ee9-10ae-4d07-ba5e-a2dfa4ec214c","number":"540","chapter":"540","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01"},{"chapter_id":"f3af5bc2-6e84-4a68-bc44-bee10b737afe","number":"539","chapter":"539","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28"},{"chapter_id":"ed4d549d-4f64-4dfa-aaea-ae23ae96719e","number":"538","chapter":"538","title":"","date":"2026-07-25","released":"2026-07-25"},{"chapter_id":"77de886e-a492-4849-875f-6427476c57b5","number":"537","chapter":"537","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"a1da4fa0-a0a1-452e-9e6d-a8e814bbaeee","number":"536","chapter":"536","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"55a8a20e-cf92-45d1-b7ca-b7e177deabf3","number":"535","chapter":"535","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"499ebca7-2fbf-453f-8c09-a2345a96e625","number":"534","chapter":"534","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"315bf1f8-758d-4da0-86a8-8740275dc30f","number":"533","chapter":"533","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10"},{"chapter_id":"9ea30774-eee5-4ff5-ba5c-2e69311783b8","number":"532","chapter":"532","title":"","date":"2026-06-30","released":"